-- Zeus fork: seed each fixed mode assistant's skill preset.
--
-- The three per-agent generated definitions were created empty ([]) before
-- the knowledge-work corpus was vendored. Fill each with its mode's share so
-- existing databases get the same starting point fresh installs get from
-- reconcile_generated_assistant (aionui-assistant/zeus_mode_presets.rs).
-- Skill entries are NAMES resolved against the catalog at conversation
-- create, not row ids, so the lists are stable across machines.
--
-- Only rows still carrying the untouched empty default are updated: a list
-- the user has deliberately edited (or cleared) is left exactly as-is.

